cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper.
title: Aperiodic EEG and rTMS outcome in major depressive disorder
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and interactive application for the evaluation of resting EEG
  features as predictors of response to repetitive transcranial magnetic
  stimulation, with permutation-calibrated nulls, explicit artefact control and
  leave-one-protocol-out transportability testing.
type: software
